<title>POLAND: BANK SLASKI 96 NET RISES TO PLN 306 MLN.</title>
<headline>BANK SLASKI 96 NET RISES TO PLN 306 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results December</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					  8.47 vs   18.30 loss</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   18.82 vs   31.78</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 76.07 vs   91.73</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     116.39 vs  149.75</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					305.96 vs  257.85</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				  445.66 vs  422.18</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		811.93 vs  724.26</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues   1.375.29 vs1.184.63</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Slaski SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
